<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 500 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 500 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 500 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills, the amount on offer after banks bid for 673 million zloty worth of the paper, the bank said.</p>
<p>The average accepted yield was 19.97 percent, 0.02 point up from the last auction on October 25, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
